{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_005_1000_p", "source_sha256": "51c3e20427fcc2248e9ecd9780661f80c7187e986b2a6f3fd48439a7ee588171", "ja": "（恵美に、イベント出演のオファーが来た！\nといっても、ごく小さいステージだが……）", "zh": "（有活动演出的邀约找上惠美了！\n不过，说是活动，其实只是个很小的舞台……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_005_1001_p", "source_sha256": "5e6a9d4191dc195c2fdc19c68916e504807b6af535cfb4a0806d7e75e0f1c0e7", "ja": "（スタッフさん達も最小限なため、\nCD販売などは、全部自分達でやる事になった）", "zh": "（工作人员也只有最少的配置，所以CD销售之类的事，都得由我们自己来做。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_005_1002_020meg", "source_sha256": "d21105d5765ff3db0fabe9b0f3c944b140b0e28babee802450d2cfa269367e0f", "ja": "{$P$}、CDのダンボールは\nあっちだって。アタシたちで運んじゃおっか？", "zh": "{$P$}，CD的纸箱在那边。我们自己搬过去吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_005_1003_p", "source_sha256": "ffa930fb3beb054ebe3699c5ca5c3ed78db67196c977eb01d55d4bb1b44db392", "ja": "いや、ダンボールは重いから俺が持つよ。\n……よいしょっと！", "zh": "不用，纸箱很重，我来搬吧。\n……嘿咻！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_005_1004_020meg", "source_sha256": "8c8b2dd47dee3a19a0571efdde192c40e7274d9ff18d622e5e2f02c1cbb3f633", "ja": "おお～！　2箱いっぺんなんて、力持ち～♪\n{$P$}、やっぱ頼りになるね！", "zh": "哇～！一次搬2箱，力气真大～♪\n{$P$}，果然还是很可靠呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_005_1005_p", "source_sha256": "693343c31308a04f8e4359d8d8303033934b03e4ce93c054c572cb9e35a73e8f", "ja": "これくらい、どうって事ないよ。\n……よし、運び終わったぞ。", "zh": "这点东西，算不了什么。\n……好了，已经搬完了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_005_1006_staff", "source_sha256": "7e907bfef6e37cbe371a0bea0d48a1d57b1ce3db63caf5644ac982f43ff74b9a", "ja": "すみません、ありがとうございます！　所さん、\n出演者なのにこんなに手伝ってもらってしまって……。", "zh": "不好意思，谢谢你！所小姐，明明是出演者，却让你帮了我这么多……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_005_1007_020meg", "source_sha256": "98217e26db5e631da694a59915496b7e4df4ce9c601917ebcba1bda826233b2e", "ja": "いいっていいって！\nだってコレ、アタシたちのCDだしさ。", "zh": "没事没事！\n因为这可是我们的CD嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_005_1008_020meg", "source_sha256": "81bf92108675a52116d7e696211e206f6e21a14243b22141c170adcd8c8e900d", "ja": "それに、じっとしてると緊張しちゃうんだよね～。\n体動かしてたほうが楽しいし！　にゃはは♪", "zh": "而且，一直待着不动会让人紧张嘛～  \n还是活动活动身体更开心！呀哈哈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_005_1009_staff", "source_sha256": "2a9cbed4d3f7e3edbef43562f1fea90cd5ad0a23b87a217e44e1f8e719d7a9e1", "ja": "ありがとうございます、助かります！", "zh": "感激不尽，得救了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_005_1010_020meg", "source_sha256": "1198d383a52bbf2afff3366ae9bfbe8a3702ea8bc5243ad16978b59ebbf1876b", "ja": "どういたしまして！\nお互いに準備、頑張ろうね♪", "zh": "不客气！\n我们一起努力准备吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
