{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_005_1012_020meg", "source_sha256": "abe7a04caaaacbd8db7568cb03bb53b3657784c92fac29a2725e32885e353538", "ja": "ん？　どしたの、{$P$}。\nアタシのこと、じっと見ちゃったりして。", "zh": "嗯？怎么了，{$P$}。\n一直盯着我看，是怎么回事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_005_1013_p", "source_sha256": "c572859395d0b6d3d741801282b6c784f1867716d851afbc3c6ce917889bac3a", "ja": "ああ、いや。恵美、\n衣装のスカートの裾が、ほつれてないか？", "zh": "啊，不是。我说惠美，你演出服的裙摆是不是脱线了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_005_1014_020meg", "source_sha256": "4f13e8b2251f20163366a119a4a0c8670b896771ae216c0de167a103ffb15d07", "ja": "え？　……ありゃ、ホントだ。\nさっき、どこかで引っかけちゃったのかな？", "zh": "诶？……哎呀，还真是。\n刚才是不是在哪里勾到了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_005_1015_020meg", "source_sha256": "a647aad3ead3a845310530dc0f8da5f493cf553f3f2eb8231f7e15b98e2059e8", "ja": "あ、でも大丈夫だよ、{$P$}。\nこれくらい、すぐ直しちゃうからさ。", "zh": "啊，不过没事的，{$P$}。\n这种程度的，我马上就能修好啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_005_1016_p", "source_sha256": "832e050302ddd3579c8b77a0f6f49d3f53641786217a7a3b7de3c0a7cb8dbe17", "ja": "え？　恵美、自分でできるのか？", "zh": "诶？惠美，你自己能搞定吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_005_1017_020meg", "source_sha256": "2bdebf2f78af239e68a106cba386fa0ba7b3206d5c17f2e658b28d8fd0cd2b38", "ja": "まかせてよ！\nアタシ、こういうの得意なんだよね～。", "zh": "包在我身上吧！\n我挺拿手这种事的呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
