{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_005_1022_020meg", "source_sha256": "7832be58f13984a35447c9d7ad09a148b2dd779d68353433b9114b739b71031b", "ja": "や、やっぱ恥ずかしいから、向こうで直してくるね？\nえへへ……。", "zh": "还、还是有点不好意思，我去那边弄好就回来哦？\n嘿嘿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
