{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_005_1024_p", "source_sha256": "d9b893af233eabb3a0fbba636fc2a1469361be60fd59c909fc914001b8571ee4", "ja": "おっ、もうできたのか！\nどれどれ……おお、本当に元通りだ。", "zh": "哦，已经做好了吗！\n我看看……哦，真的恢复原样了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
